              <!-- caption plate -->
              <g text-anchor="middle">
                <text x="310" y="446" fill="#3a382f"
                  style="font-family:Archivo,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-stretch:74%;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.2em;">
                  MZ · TRANSPORT
                </text>
              </g>
            </svg>
            <figcaption class="sr-only">A reel-to-reel transport, threaded and ready — a stand-in
              for downloaded tracks kept as your own copy on the device.</figcaption>
          </figure>

          <div class="reel-copy">
            <h2 id="hf-reel">Take it with you</h2>
            <p>Download a record and it is yours to keep on the device — a real copy on your own
              hardware, not a cache the app can quietly revoke. On a plane, underground or off the
              grid, it plays exactly like it does at home.</p>
            <p>The whole catalogue is indexed locally too, so browsing and search never wait on a
              network. Offline was designed in from the start, not bolted on afterwards.</p>
            <ul class="reel-tags" role="list">
              <li><span class="led led-red is-on tiny" aria-hidden="true"></span> Your own copy</li>
              <li><span class="led led-red is-on tiny" aria-hidden="true"></span> On-device catalogue</li>
              <li><span class="led led-red is-on tiny" aria-hidden="true"></span> Plays with no signal</li>
            </ul>
